      "content": "\"Making the machine stop running\" means finding a way to break the cycle, even if it's just for a moment. You don't have to quit everything to stop feeling this way; you can start by finding a way to make the *feeling* stop. Think about what would make the next hour feel less like a chore and more like something you actually chose.",
      "source": "target",
